, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, at $189/night, so $378 total (reservation R0003). This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nThe booking didn't go through cleanly the first time. The first try timed out. When I retried, the system said the flight had been charged ($289, reservation R0001) but the hotel booking had failed. I used the system's built-in fix to undo that partial booking, which cancelled and refunded R0001, and then sent the full booking again. Dana's reservation list now shows R0001 as cancelled and only R0002 and R0003 as active, so nothing was booked or charged twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015GRqrGVhKavNRejCvqBMd3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CSE8BK5yVeEpXbv31hboq9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: 289 + 378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PPXagD4PPck2sTpjkkyR56", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01VBQJtX6R8vfz89tJyaryrd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", 